<title>USA: Alpharma gets FDA nod on M-Zole 7 product.</title>
<headline>Alpharma gets FDA nod on M-Zole 7 product.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LEE, N.J. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpharma Inc said Monday that its U.S. Pharmaceuticals Division has received approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to manufacture and market its M-Zole 7 Dual Pack product.</p>
<p>Alpharma said M-Zole 7 is a brand equivalent to the Monistat-7 combination pack produced by Johnson and Johnson Ortho Consumer Products.</p>
<p>The M-Zole 7 dual pact is expected to be sold beginning September, the company said.</p>
</text>
